    "Capture the source frame and source identities after source picking; resolve named/viewport targets without editing cameras or planes.",
    "Support CPlane/View getters, quote-aware complete options, Copy and remembered successful choices; canceled Copy edits retain the previous default.",
    "Reject identical frames in either Copy mode while leaving the interactive target getter open.",
    "Use the measured native Bottom target basis (-X,+Y,-Z); leave the existing CPlane editor preset unchanged.",
    "Keep unit frame axes independent of model distance tolerance, including explicit TargetFrame batch input."
